Package: boilerplate
Title: Tools for Managing and Compiling Manuscript Templates
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Joseph", "Bulbulia", email = "joseph.bulbulia@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5861-2056"))
Description: The `boilerplate` package provides tools for managing and generating standardised text for methods and results sections of scientific reports. It handles template variable substitution and supports hierarchical organization of text through dot-separated paths.
